{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19894","headline":"失意归吴因寄东台刘复侍御 · 孟郊","name":"失意归吴因寄东台刘复侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自念西上身，忽随东归风。\n长安日下影，又落江湖中。\n离娄岂不明，子野岂不聪。\n至宝非眼别，至音非耳通。\n因缄俗外词，仰寄高天鸿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}